        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joey Graceffa, Jennette McCurdy, Jamie Kennedy, Eugenia Cooney, CupcakKe, Aislinn Paul, Chris Crocker, Dita von Teese, Farrah Abraham\n- Shows: Shane and Friends\n- Platforms: YouTube\n- Roles: YouTube personality, actor, author, producer, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Shane and Friends interviewed celebrities including Joey Graceffa, Jennette McCurdy, Jamie Kennedy, Eugenia Cooney, CupcakKe, Aislinn Paul, Chris Crocker, Dita von Teese, and Farrah Abraham.\n- Joseph Michael Graceffa was born on May 16, 1991.\n- Joey Graceffa is an American YouTube personality, actor, author, producer, and singer.\n- Joey Graceffa has two active YouTube channels, and both channels are named after him.\n- One Joey Graceffa YouTube channel is used for vlogging, and the other Joey Graceffa YouTube channel is used for video gaming content.\n- Joey Graceffa's two YouTube channels have a combined total of more than 1.7 billion views.",
